{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "p360-agenda-fase5",
    "name": "Paciente360 — Agenda (Fase 5)",
    "description": "Coleção da API REST do módulo de Agendamento — Fase 5.\n\n## Pré-requisitos\n\n1. **Auth**: faça login via collection `Paciente360 API v1 (Bearer)` — `POST /auth/login` salva `{{token}}` e `{{tenant_slug}}`. Esta collection consome essas variáveis.\n2. **Tenant slug**: header `X-Tenant-Slug` injetado automaticamente em TODAS as requests autenticadas (Princípio II — triple-check anti-token-roubo cross-tenant).\n3. **Migrations + seeders**: `vendor/bin/sail artisan migrate && vendor/bin/sail artisan db:seed --class=AgendaPermissionsSeeder` antes de testar.\n\n## Variáveis utilizadas\n\n- `base_url` — default `http://api.lvh.me/api/v1`\n- `token` — preenchido pelo login (collection Fase 4)\n- `tenant_slug` — preenchido pelo login (collection Fase 4)\n- `professional_id`, `appointment_type_id`, `paciente_id`, `appointment_id`, `waitlist_id`, `calendar_sync_account_id`, `schedule_exception_id`, `slot_reservation_id`, `slot_starts_at` — IDs/timestamps usados em path/query\n\n## Estrutura\n\nPastas por user story (US-6.1 → US-6.7) + webhook Google.\n\n## Referências\n\n- Spec: `specs/005-agendamento-consultas/spec.md`\n- OpenAPI: `specs/005-agendamento-consultas/contracts/openapi.yaml`\n- Quickstart: `specs/005-agendamento-consultas/quickstart.md`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Pre-request script (collection-level) — injeta Authorization + X-Tenant-Slug",
          "// em TODAS as requests da coleção (exceto webhooks públicos).",
          "if (pm.variables.get('skipAuth')) { return; }",
          "",
          "const token = pm.collectionVariables.get('token');",
          "const tenantSlug = pm.collectionVariables.get('tenant_slug');",
          "",
          "if (token) {",
          "    pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Authorization', value: `Bearer ${token}` });",
          "}",
          "if (tenantSlug) {",
          "    pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Tenant-Slug', value: tenantSlug });",
          "}",
          ""
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://api.lvh.me/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tenant_slug", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "professional_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "appointment_type_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "paciente_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "appointment_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "waitlist_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "calendar_sync_account_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "schedule_exception_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "slot_reservation_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "slot_starts_at", "value": "2026-06-15T09:00:00-03:00", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "US-6.1 — Schedule + Exceptions",
      "description": "Configuração de agenda recorrente do profissional + bloqueios pontuais (clarify nº 5 — dual ownership médico/admin).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET schedule do profissional",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/agenda/professionals/{{professional_id}}/schedules",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["agenda", "professionals", "{{professional_id}}", "schedules"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT atualiza schedule (batch)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/agenda/professionals/{{professional_id}}/schedules",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["agenda", "professionals", "{{professional_id}}", "schedules"]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"timezone\": \"America/Sao_Paulo\",\n  \"schedules\": [\n    { \"day_of_week\": 1, \"blocks\": [{\"start\":\"08:00\",\"end\":\"12:00\"},{\"start\":\"13:00\",\"end\":\"18:00\"}] },\n    { \"day_of_week\": 2, \"blocks\": [{\"start\":\"08:00\",\"end\":\"18:00\"}] },\n    { \"day_of_week\": 3, \"blocks\": [{\"start\":\"08:00\",\"end\":\"18:00\"}] },\n    { \"day_of_week\": 4, \"blocks\": [{\"start\":\"08:00\",\"end\":\"18:00\"}] },\n    { \"day_of_week\": 5, \"blocks\": [{\"start\":\"08:00\",\"end\":\"12:00\"}] }\n  ],\n  \"accepted_appointment_type_ids\": [{{appointment_type_id}}]\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET exceptions (bloqueios)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/agenda/professionals/{{professional_id}}/schedule-exceptions?from=2026-06-01&to=2026-12-31",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["agenda", "professionals", "{{professional_id}}", "schedule-exceptions"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "from", "value": "2026-06-01" },
                { "key": "to", "value": "2026-12-31" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST cria exception",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/agenda/professionals/{{professional_id}}/schedule-exceptions",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["agenda", "professionals", "{{professional_id}}", "schedule-exceptions"]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"starts_at\": \"2026-06-10T00:00:00-03:00\",\n  \"ends_at\": \"2026-06-20T23:59:59-03:00\",\n  \"reason\": \"Férias\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "FR-028c — consultas existentes nessa janela serão canceladas em cascade com motivo `schedule_exception`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE exception",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/agenda/schedule-exceptions/{{schedule_exception_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["agenda", "schedule-exceptions", "{{schedule_exception_id}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
